OL,3,GNEWSAWho is in charge at Gloucester
OL,4,ACity Council?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been four weeks since Gloucester
OL,7,FCity Council voted to depose its leader
OL,8,Fand the cabinet resigned en masse.
OL,10,FSince then, the council has been
OL,11,Fleaderless and no candidate has yet
OL,12,Femerged who everyone can get behind.
OL,14,FThe BBC contacted the city council this
OL,15,Fweek asking several questions, such as
OL,16,Fhow long it can go on without a leader
OL,17,Fand what happens if one cannot be
OL,18,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
