OL,3,GNEWSAWho is in charge at Gloucester
OL,4,ACity Council?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council declined to answer the
OL,7,FBBC's specific questions, but said it
OL,8,Fcontinues to "operate as normal" with
OL,9,Fofficers "focused on council
OL,10,Fpriorities".
